<view class="page" wx:if="{{!success}}"><view class="title">记录这次完攀</view><view class="subtitle">让这次上墙，成为看得见的成长。</view><view class="video card" bindtap="chooseVideo"><video wx:if="{{videoPath}}" src="{{videoPath}}" controls></video><view wx:else><view class="plus">＋</view><view class="video-title">选择 MP4 完攀视频</view><view class="muted">建议 60 秒以内</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{submitting && videoPath}}" class="upload-box card"><image class="loading-cat" src="/assets/mascot-loading.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="between"><text class="upload-title">小猫正在搬运视频</text><text class="percent">{{uploadProgress}}%</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{uploadProgress}}%"></view></view><view class="loading-dots"><text></text><text></text><text></text></view><view class="muted progress-tip">分片失败会自动重试，请不要退出</view></view><view class="card field"><text>尝试次数</text><input type="number" value="{{attempts}}" bindinput="attempts"/></view><view class="card"><textarea placeholder="写下这条线的感受或 Beta…" maxlength="300" bindinput="caption"/></view><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting?'正在上传 '+uploadProgress+'%':'完成打卡'}}</button></view>
<view class="success-page" wx:else><view class="success-title">{{milestone?'新突破！':'完攀！'}}</view><image class="success-cat" src="/assets/mascot-celebrate.jpg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="milestone" wx:if="{{milestone}}">首次完攀 {{milestone.grade}}</view><view class="success-copy">{{milestone?'恭喜解锁新的最高难度':'太棒了，这次进步已经记下来了'}}</view><view class="points-earned">本次获得 +{{pointsEarned}} 分</view><view class="success-sub">继续积累，你会看到自己越爬越高。</view><button class="primary success-button" bindtap="finish">继续探索线路</button></view>
